1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,447
The surface through all those points is a wavefront: the locus of points vibrating in the same phase.

2
00:00:07,447 --> 00:00:12,877
The perpendicular to a wavefront, in the direction the wave moves, is a ray.

3
00:00:12,877 --> 00:00:16,992
And the wavefront moves at the speed of the wave in that medium.

